        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Komi Paulo ak Barnaba Ikomio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kimi Ikonio, koba tuwai agoi sunagogitab Yahudik, ak kong’alal kot koyan tuiyet ne o ne bo Yahudik ak Yunanik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiim Yahudik che ki bistoik sobonwekab Bororiosiek kot kogochi kowech tupchosiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitebe oloto anyun betusiek che chang’ ak kong’alali eng’ nyiganatet agobo Kiptaiyat, ne kibaorianji ng’olyotab mieindanyi, ak kogochin koyaak kaborunoik ak kwong’utik eng’ eunekwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kipcheigei tuiyet ne bo nganaset; ak kinamgei alage ak Yahudik, konamgei alage ak che kiyoktoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kimachei Bororiosiek ak Yahudik koboto bounikwak kobokyi ichek, kole koyachi ne ya, ak kolach eng’ koik, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kosib konai, ak kimwechi Lustra ak Derbe, nganasok che bo Lukaonia, ak korotinwek che negite oloto: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiamda logoiywek che miach eng’ oloto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Komi Lustra",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitebyei chito age eng’ Lustra, ne kima ko kimen kelyekyik, ne ki solomwo koboch komi moetab kamet, ne kitomo kowendot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigas chichoto Paulo kong’alali: ak kingochiilji kong’ inendet chichoto, ak kogeer kole tinyei kayanet ne kimuchi kisoob, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "komwa eng’ kutit ne o kole, Tonon komie eng’ kelyeguk. Ak kitoromben ak kowendot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer tuiyosiek kit ne kayai Paulo, kobolyo eng’ ng’alekab Lukaonia, kole, Kachorjech ge cheptalelisiek eng’ kergeindab bik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiguure Barnaba, Seu; koguure Paulo, Herme, amu ki ng’alalindet ne o inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiget tisiindetab Seu ne kimi hekalunnyi taitab nganaset, tuga ak sinendoik kobwa kurgotik, ak kimachei inendet koboto tuiyosiek kogoito tisieywot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ye kingogas agobo noto che kiyoktoi Barnaba ak Paulo, kogerer ngoroikwak, ak koruai koba kwenutab tuiyet, koboldos, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kolen, Murenju, kalya si oyai tuguchu? Ki bik agachek, che kergei ak okwek, ak kagiibwok logoiywek che miach, si kobiit oweige omete tuguchu matilei kiy ak obwanji Jehovah ne sobei, inendet ne kiyaei kipsengwet ak ng’ony ak nyanjet, ak tugul che mi oloto: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kibagakyi inendet bororiosiek tugul eng’ ibinwek che kigosiirto, kobendat eng’ ortinwekwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kima tebi buch inendet ama tinyei baoria, amu kiyai ne mie, ak kogonok ropta ne bunu kipsengwet ak betusiekab ruratet, kogochin kobiyong’so mugulelwekwok eng’ amitwogik ak kagasetab ge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ki negit kotemene koger tuiyosiek eng’ ng’alechu si mata kogochi tiseiywot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kibwa Yahudik che kibunu Antiokia ak Ikonia: ak kingo kagolom tuiyosiek, kolach Paulo eng’ koik, ak kochuut komanda eng’ nganaset, kolen kagome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ye kitonondos alamalyet ko kayiem inendet, kong’eet, ak kwo nganaset: ak eng’ betut ne kiisubi noto koba Derbe ak Barnaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koweekyingei che kiyoktoi Antiokia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingo kagoamji logoiywek che miach nganasanato, ak ko kagoyai che chang’ koek alamalyet, koweektagei koba Lustra, ak Ikonia, agoi Antiokia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kogimitoti sobonwekab alamalyet, kogiili koba tai eng’ kayanet, ak kolenji, kanyol keit bounatetab Jehovah eng’ nyalilwogik che chang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagolewenji ichek boisiek eng’ kaniset age tugul, ak kosa eng’ karugutetab ge, konde ichek eutab Kiptaiyat, ne kiga koyan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibun Pisidia, ak koit Pampulia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagoamda ng’olyot eng’ Perga, kochortagei Atalia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kibun melit eng’ oloto agoi Antiokia, oloto ole kigindae ichek mieindab Jehovah agobo boisiet ne kiga koyai kosulda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
